    The future addcdiv behavior is just the latter implementation:
    (input + value * tensor1 / tensor2), for all dtypes.

.. math::
    \text{out}_i = \text{input}_i + \text{value} \times \frac{\text{tensor1}_i}{\text{tensor2}_i}


